://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-iOouwm4DOEQ7kNvwFx-E0u&_nc_oc=Adpic3PNeM9A82kHMIYakPBIwAX8Illk-2LIkcfxG1Ingm5q2n6cf16t5hpbpE1n1rg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_muEVWhStSl0XhdOYcGIkY4fljRexJJVBCoKzLrSkilw&oe=6A282C66"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tBNcUhc0RhwQ7kNvwEc12ZO&_nc_oc=AdrPvBAISteb5nr15r9gZ2SwdXvi3Z6E-UikeJma6DDVU-B3MHb4j4fd6kTxURBIrlM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af90ZYmh5y7mZF_8JaRJ2K1dyvzEh4DY-euxzmHbyEDhlQ&oe=6A2821B2"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W0wwCoFS0vgQ7kNvwE7VhfX&_nc_oc=Adr5pxqSFQqp67bfEbTXSCcDo8BQUmZCFAActEBKu8i5p_labl6z9PhXm4hcdC-c8YA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_K0m9xnuj25Y5PZ6WIQXyodJzv5CzGC6iWq5_Cf_Rf6Q&oe=6A281B7B"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FkM-harkerMQ7kNvwGiIIDi&_nc_oc=AdpiLkoannFwIk88mgUq4kmDWetrpsUzPbjzmJNaVMAmI9qkScsHxAA5Q3vyrfowNBQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8A5-sBV1fkPW8CyC81H_C37RbEVJSmn7vggaRzaecPNA&oe=6A2830F3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wOc0Dd-2sZgQ7kNvwHi-QXM&_nc_oc=AdoOOj9mwxDaMDUgUARXRL-386jnrrBxhB4Dh9kswHJKYrWk2pXlhP7LuIx8P0t9OXg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-x6bAG1lIzuOOGskgU7qfOB39eejXGhx8M3yWVoOb_Zg&oe=6A282EF2"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wjlx6RLrH0EQ7kNvwE3wI2l&_nc_oc=AdpW92PzSlWdBAwwFqE6v3SlUF7CWWAH2EqNIcpsXkXBpXj-eu_L8twubPBw_Z-C7lQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8CJXn8HvcrtFgU_WDRJ3NAZtW9BMPxu0nYNZWcoxVocQ&oe=6A282653"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zZgX3pZuDRkQ7kNvwFMj7fO&_nc_oc=AdpqWtDRqvViyEt_S8uoRuZorPuIUt7Xz7A4yDGXyrHsKDSGWKLx7PJHQsKlO0lN2BI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-YyJMIWfe6lYoqcZIqNENGjAuFAfzZEOMIOQWLvqYcQA&oe=6A28226F"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m8WQts-972sQ7kNvwHkvGhc&_nc_oc=AdoASvC3Bn9jnnFrH-nY8Ibho1VQKNA40MCt1XTpbXdXekEebMuBkpLyhxUSH06UpIA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af--rogsFdc7E1khRtd5IwPQGnyY0bJTMl7rfpSz5wFMBQ&oe=6A282E22"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_521808747164